# Black Widow, Double Agent: "Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, it gains first strike and menace until end of
# turn." Attacking together, Widow and Ornithopter get nothing (turn 3). Ornithopter attacking alone gets both, and loses them
# at end of turn (turn 5); Widow attacking alone gets them too (turn 7), and so does a creature that is not her.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Black Widow, Double Agent
Ornithopter
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Widow, Double Agent.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Attackers]
Bot1.Attack(Black Widow, Double Agent > Bot2; Ornithopter > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Black Widow, Double Agent.Keywords = Deathtouch
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying
[T5 Bot1.Attackers]
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = FirstStrike; Flying; Menace
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
[T7 Bot1.Attackers]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying
Bot1.Attack(Black Widow, Double Agent > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Widow, Double Agent.Keywords = Deathtouch; FirstStrike; Menace
